[[Leather Armor]] is an [[Armor]] available in the shop for all characters, at rare rarity. In its base form it gives the lowest {{icon/block}} of any [[Armor]] with the exception of [[Mage]]'s [[Shiny Mantle]], and tied with [[Dragonscale Armor]]. [[Leather Armor]] can be upgraded fairly easily to [[Ice Armor]] with a [[Snowball]], or [[Vampiric Armor]] with a [[Blood Amulet]], which are both significant upgrades. When playing Berserker or otherwise obtaining the [[Forging Hammer]], the [[Leather Armor]] can trivially be upgraded into the [[Dragonscale Armor]], although this is more of a lateral conversion into something similarly powerful, just more synergistic with [[Battle Rage]]. If [[Twine]] can be obtained, such as through playing [[Adventurer]], the [[Leather Armor]] can be combined with the [[Customer Card]] to obtain the [[Employee Uniform]], which is better across the board and gives a high chance of [[Trade]].
